    "1 scoop whey protein powder, or to taste",
    "0.5 cup blueberries",
    "2 tablespoons pumpkin seeds, or to taste",
    "2 tablespoons raisins, or to taste",
    "0.25 cup skim milk, or as needed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Combine oatmeal and protein powder in a microwave-safe bowl. Stir in blueberries, pumpkin seeds, and raisins; add milk. Microwave for about 1 minute. Stir before serving.",
